WEBVTT

00:01:27.032 --> 00:01:30.264
Is it fair to leave Susan home alone,

00:01:30.288 --> 00:01:33.111
dealing with her own grief and pain?

00:01:35.018 --> 00:01:36.168
At the end,

00:01:36.192 --> 00:01:39.384
I made the decision to go back to work,

00:01:39.408 --> 00:01:42.049
and I am very glad I did.

00:01:44.045 --> 00:01:46.847
We all experience grief
and loss in our lives.

00:01:47.411 --> 00:01:48.961
For most of us,

00:01:48.985 --> 00:01:53.684
that means, at some point,
getting up and getting back to work

00:01:53.708 --> 00:01:55.530
while living with the grief.

00:01:56.162 --> 00:01:57.791
On those days,

00:01:57.815 --> 00:02:01.879
we will continue to carry
the incredible burden of sadness,